<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">söllent</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ir</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gäben</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bächer</unclear>, ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">het</unclear> üch selber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geschriben</unclear>, so ist
<lb n="11"/>es mir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wägen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">großer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">blödigkeit</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schwachheit</unclear> nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">müglich</unclear>,
